    "text": "22 hours ago CLEVELAND, Tenn. - Lee University Athletics and the Lee University men's basketball team are mourning the loss of longtime Flame Noah Boler-Kyle, who was called home to Heaven July 10, 2026. Boler-Kyle, age 25, was a six-year member of the Flames from 2019-2025 and a five-year starter on the court.... Read full article",
